                        1265 --1355: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        1266 --1356:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        1267 --1357:  * \brief       Perform a modular exponentioation with the Chinese remainder theorem.
                        1268 --1358:  * \param       [in,out]  p_prm         Parameters to be calculated
                        1269 --1359:  * \param       [in]  p_ctx             A pointer to a structure that summarizes the parameters required by RSA.
