                                                                      Page 22
                                                              C:\Users\a5152492\AppData\Local\Temp\gh_0000bis1.si
                        1271 --1361:  * \return
                        1272 --1362:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
                        1273 --1363:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PROCESSING:          Successfully done.
                        1274 --1364:  *                                   Next half of the operation unprocessed.
                        1275 --1365:  *  - #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR:         Internal processing failed
                        1276 --1366:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted
                        1277 --1367:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        1278 --1368:  * \par Security components
