                        1377 --1474: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        1378 --1475:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        1379 --1476:  * \brief       Finalize a modular exponentioation with the Chinese remainder theorem.
                        1380 --1477:  * \param       [in]  p_prm              Parameters to be calculated
                        1381 --1478:  * \param       [out] p_msg_out           An address where the modular exponentiation  result is output. <br>
