                                                              C:\Users\a5152492\AppData\Local\Temp\gh_0000bis1.si
                        1515 --1624:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted
                        1516 --1625:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        1517 --1626:  *  - #PKCD_RET_RSA_NON_COPRIME:     (e and p-1), (e and q-1) or (p and q) are not co-prime.
