                        1751 --1870:  *   - There was no error in PKCC operation
                        1752 --1871:  *   - The cmp_ret and cmp_ret is not 0 (u and v is not 0)
                        1753 --1872:  *   -# If u is an even number, processing is done with the #r_pkcd_rsa_ex_gcd_calc_even
                        1754 --1873:  *   -# If v is an even number, processing is done with the #r_pkcd_rsa_ex_gcd_calc_even
                        1755 --1874:  *   -# If u >= v then
                        1756 --1875:  *     -# Calculate u = u - v with the #r_pkcd_cmn_AMinusB
                        1757 --1876:  *     -# Calculate A = A - C with the #r_pkcd_rsa_ex_gcd_AMinusB
                        1758 --1877:  *     -# Calculate B = B - D with the #r_pkcd_rsa_ex_gcd_AMinusB

                                                                      Page 30
                                                              C:\Users\a5152492\AppData\Local\Temp\gh_0000bis1.si
                        1759 --1878:  *   -# Else
                        1760 --1879:  *     -# Calculate v = v - u with the #r_pkcd_cmn_AMinusB
                        1761 --1880:  *     -# Calculate C = C - A with the #r_pkcd_rsa_ex_gcd_AMinusB
                        1762 --1881:  *     -# Calculate D = D - B with the #r_pkcd_rsa_ex_gcd_AMinusB
                        1763 --1882:  *   -# Check if u is 0 and set the result to cmp_ret
                        1764 --1883:  *   -# Check if v is 0 and set the result to cmp_ret2
                        1765 --1884:  *   -# Increment timeout counter
                        1766 --1885:  * -# If timeout count >= #PKCD_RSA_EX_GCD_LOOP_TIMEOUT then
                        1767 --1886:  *   -# Set ret to #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR
                        1768 --1887:  * -# If #PKCD_RET_OK == ret then
