                        1973 --2129: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        1974 --2130:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        1975 --2131:  * \brief       Calculate the modular inversion acording to Binary extended gcd algorithm
                        1976 --2132:  * \param       [in]  p_a       An address of operand.
                        1977 --2133:  * \param       [in]  alen      A byte size of operand.
                        1978 --2134:  * \param       [in]  p_m       An address of modulo.
                        1979 --2135:  * \param       [in]  mlen      A byte size of m.
                        1980 --2136:  * \param       [out] p_ainv    An address of the buffer that outputs the inverse of a after calculation.
                        1981 --2137:  * \param       [in]  p_buf     An address of the temporary buffer.
                        1982 --2138:  * \return
                        1983 --2139:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
