                        1985 --2141:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted
                        1986 --2142:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        1987 --2143:  *  - #PKCD_RET_RSA_NON_COPRIME:     a and m are not co-prime
                        1988 --2144:  * \par Security components
                        1989 --2145:  *  - No
                        1990 --2146:  * \par Global Variables
                        1991 --2147:  *  - None
                        1992 --2148:  * \par Registers Used
