                        1994 --2150:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STC, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPA, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPB, <br>
                        1995 --2151:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPS (Used by sub functions)
                        1996 --2152:  * \par Precondition
                        1997 --2153:  *  - None
                        1998 --2154:  * \par Detailed description
                        1999 --2155:  *      - Calculate the modular inversion acording to Binary extended gcd altorithm.
                        2000 --2156:  *      - The algorithm is described in chapter 14.61 of HANDBOOK of APPLIED CRYPTOGRAPHY.
                        2001 --2157:  * \par Remarks
                        2002 --2158:  *  - None

                                                                      Page 34
