                        2041 --2202: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        2042 --2203:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        2043 --2204:  * \brief       Calculate m1, m2 to be used in CRT mode
                        2044 --2205:  * \param       [in] p_msg          An address of message
                        2045 --2206:  * \param       [in] msg_len        A byte size of message.
                        2046 --2207:  * \param       [in] p_pq           An address of p or q.
                        2047 --2208:  * \param       [in] p_dpq          An address of dp or dq.
