                        2450 --2640:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STC, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPA, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPB, <br>
                        2451 --2641:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPC, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPS (Used by sub functions)
                        2452 --2642:  * \par Precondition
                        2453 --2643:  *  - None
                        2454 --2644:  * \par Detailed description
                        2455 --2645:  *      - Test if given value is a prime number using the Miller-Rabin algorithm.
                        2456 --2646:  *      - See the #R_PKCD_RsaTestPrime function for the validity of iteration number for each bit number.
                        2457 --2647:  * \par Remarks
