                        2811 --3035: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        2812 --3036:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        2813 --3037:  * \brief       Perform processing when u or v is even number for binary extended gbd algorithm
                        2814 --3038:  * \param       [in,out]  p_wks     An address of structure having works area for binary extended gbd algorithm.
                        2815 --3039:  * \param       [in]      p_xy      An address of structure having x and y data buffer pointer <br>
                        2816 --3040:  *                                  for binary extended gbd algorithm.
                        2817 --3041:  * \param       [in]      len       A byte size of data length.
