                        2820 --3044:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
                        2821 --3045:  *  - #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR:         Internal processing failed
                        2822 --3046:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted
                        2823 --3047:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        2824 --3048:  * \par Security components
                        2825 --3049:  *  - No
                        2826 --3050:  * \par Global Variables
                        2827 --3051:  *  - None
                        2828 --3052:  * \par Registers Used
                        2829 --3053:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0CR, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STR,  <br>
                        2830 --3054:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STC, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPA, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPB, <br>
                        2831 --3055:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPS (Used by sub functions)
                        2832 --3056:  * \par Precondition
                        2833 --3057:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR (DL bit) value must have been set beforehand.
                        2834 --3058:  * \par Detailed description
                        2835 --3059:  *      - When the value of u or v is even, calculate according to binary extended gbd algorithm.
                        2836 --3060:  *      - If the processing loop exceeds the specified number, an error is returned.
                        2837 --3061:  * \par Remarks
                        2838 --3062:  *  - None
                        2839 --3063:  *
                        2840 --3064:  * Pseudo-code for the function can be found below.
                        2841 --3065:  * -# Initialize the variable ret with #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR.
                        2842 --3066:  * -# Get the least significant byte of u or v(hereinafter called the "uv").
                        2843 --3067:  * -# Clear timeout count
                        2844 --3068:  * -# Loop while in the following case
                        2845 --3069:  *   - The timeout counter has not exceeded the #PKCD_RSA_EX_GCD_LOOP_TIMEOUT
                        2846 --3070:  *   - The lsb is even
                        2847 --3071:  *   - There was no error in PKCC operation
