                        2937 --3172: **********************************************************************************************************************/
                        2938 --3173: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        2939 --3174:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        2940 --3175:  * \brief       Calculate the addition for binary extended gbd algorithm
                        2941 --3176:  * \param       [in,out]  p_wk_a       An address of work area where either A to D is set. <br>
