                        2958 --3193:  * \par Registers Used
                        2959 --3194:  *  - #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0CR, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0OMR, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STR,  <br>
                        2960 --3195:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STC, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPA, #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0DPB, <br>
