                        2964 --3199:  * \par Detailed description
                        2965 --3200:  *      - Calculate the addition of either A to D of binary extended gbd algorithm parameters.
                        2966 --3201:  *      - The signs is calculated separately from the value.
                        2967 --3202:  * \par Remarks
                        2968 --3203:  *  - None
