                        4020 --4307: /*!****************************************************************************************************************//**
                        4021 --4308:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        4022 --4309:  * \brief       Continue generating random numbers until a prime number is obtained.
                        4023 --4310:  *              This process follows FIPS186-4 Appendix B.3.1.
                        4024 --4311:  * \param       [in] p_keygen           An address of the buffer for the RSA key generation.
                        4025 --4312:  * \param       [in] p_ctx              An address of the context for the RSA key generation.
