                        4626 --4949:  * \ingroup     PKCDRSAAPIsInternal
                        4627 --4950:  * \brief       Check if a prime candidate given with p_pq is a prime number
                        4628 --4951:  *              and satisfies the conditions defined in FIPS186-4 appendix B.3.1.
                        4629 --4952:  * \param       [in]    p_wk_q      An address of a work area for a prime q.
                        4630 --4953:  * \param       [in]    p_p         An address of a prime (candidate) p.
                        4631 --4954:  * \param       [in]    pqlen       The length in bytes of the prime candidate.
                        4632 --4955:  * \param       [in]    p_wk1       An address of a work area.
